    rdfs:seeAlso oec:recyclableContent, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v2/terms#recycledContentPercentage>, <urn:samm:io.BatteryPass.Circularity:1.2.0#recycledContent>, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v2/terms#postConsumerRecycledContent>, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v2/terms#preConsumerRecycledContentPercentage>, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v2/terms#postConsumerRecycledMaterialComposition>, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v2/terms#preConsumerRecycledContent>, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v2/terms#preConsumerRecycledContentMass>, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v2/terms#preConsumerRecycledMaterialComposition>, <urn:samm:io.BatteryPass.Circularity:1.2.0#postConsumerShare>, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v2/terms#postConsumerRecycledContentPercentage>;
